<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>预览组件未构建</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; min-height:100vh; margin:0; background:#f8f9fa; }
        .box { max-width:560px; background:#fff; border:1px solid #dee2e6; border-radius:.75rem; padding:1.5rem; }
        pre { background:#212529; color:#f8f9fa; padding:.85rem 1rem; border-radius:.5rem; overflow:auto; }
